    "directions": [
      "Wash 2 cups of sorrel and place in a large pot",
      "Pour 8-10 cups of water over the sorrel and add 3oz grated ginger, 5 pimento seeds",
      "Add 4 clove, 1 tsp cinnamon stir well and bring to a boil ; stir and place in fridge overnight to chill. (Orange peel optional)",
      "Strain the sorrel into a bowl, make sure you push down on the sorrel to get the maximum juice out.",
      "Add 2 cups of sugar, 1 tsp lime and rum and stir well until sugar has dissolved.",
      "Serve with ice. (For maximum taste let it sit in fridge for a few days)",
      "Enjoy over ice"
    ],
